<h2 id="overview">1. Overview</h2>

<pre>
WIA-HOME: Build-Owner Free Digital Home
========================================

Problem:
  - Domain: $10-50/year
  - Hosting: $5-100/month
  - SSL: $0-200/year
  - Development: ???
  - Total: Tens of thousands per year

Solution:
  - Your PC is the server
  - Free domain (yourname.wia.home)
  - P2P network hosting
  - No landlord, forever yours

Philosophy:
  Hongik Ingan - Everyone deserves
  a home in the digital world
</pre>

<h3>Architecture</h3>
<pre>
Traditional:
  User -> AWS/Cloud -> Website
           |
         Pay rent

WIA-HOME:
  Visitor -> Your PC/Laptop <- Your home!
                |
            P2P Network
            No landlord
</pre>

